ians doing that Paul wanted them to do even more?","answer":"Paul wanted the Thessalonians to love one another even more.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"1TH","chapter":4,"verse":9,"endVerse":10,"scope":"1TH.4.9","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:1TH:4:11-12:gj89","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_1TH.tsv","sourceLine":35,"originalId":"gj89","originalReference":"4:11-12"},"book":"1TH","reference":"4:11-12","question":"What were the Thessalonians to do so that they walked properly before unbelievers and had need of nothing?","answer":"The Thessalonians were to be quiet, mind their own business, and work with their hands.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"1TH","chapter":4,"verse":11,"endVerse":12,"scope":"1TH.4.11","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:1TH:4:13:n5xh","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_1TH.tsv","sourceLine":36,"originalId":"n5xh","originalReference":"4:13"},"book":"1TH","reference":"4:13","question":"About what subject did the Thessalonians possibly have a misunderstanding?","answer":"The Thessalonians possibly had a misunderstanding about what happened to those who slept.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"1TH","chapter":4,"verse":13,"endVerse":null,"scope":"1TH.4.13","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:1TH:4:14:cc78","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_1TH.tsv","sourceLine":37,"originalId":"cc78","origina