"},"book":"1TH","reference":"5:3","question":"What will some people be saying when sudden destruction comes upon them?","answer":"Some people will be saying, “Peace and safety.”","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"1TH","chapter":5,"verse":3,"endVerse":null,"scope":"1TH.5.3","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:1TH:5:4-5:id8z","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_1TH.tsv","sourceLine":44,"originalId":"id8z","originalReference":"5:4-5"},"book":"1TH","reference":"5:4-5","question":"Why does Paul say the day of the Lord should not overtake the believers like a thief?","answer":"Because the believers are not in darkness, but are sons of the light, the day of the Lord should not overtake them like a thief.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"1TH","chapter":5,"verse":4,"endVerse":5,"scope":"1TH.5.4","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:1TH:5:6:bu2n","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_1TH.tsv","sourceLine":45,"originalId":"bu2n","originalReference":"5:6"},"book":"1TH","reference":"5:6","question":"What does Paul tell the believers to do regarding the coming day of the Lord?","answer":"Paul tells the believers to watch and be sober.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"1TH","chapter":5,"verse":6,"endVerse":null,"scope":"1TH.5.6","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:1TH:5:9:w9s4","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_1TH.tsv","sourceLine":46,"ori